variables.description:
This is the full detail to send over and format in this way: 

{"title":"Book an Appointment","subtitle":"Choose a date and time that works for you.","confirmLabel":"Confirm Appointment","noSlotsText":"No availability on this date. Please choose another day.","daysAhead":14,"availableTimes":[{"date":"2026-05-26","slots":["9:00 AM","9:30 AM","10:00 AM","10:30 AM","11:00 AM","2:00 PM","2:30 PM","3:00 PM","4:00 PM"]},{"date":"2026-05-27","slots":["9:00 AM","10:00 AM","11:30 AM","1:00 PM","3:00 PM","4:30 PM"]},{"date":"2026-05-28","slots":["8:30 AM","9:00 AM","10:30 AM","2:00 PM","3:30 PM"]}]}

Rules: 'title' is the heading shown at the top of the picker. 'subtitle' is a short descriptive line below the title. 'confirmLabel' is the text on the confirmation button. 'noSlotsText' is the message shown when a selected date has no available slots. 'daysAhead' is an integer controlling how many days forward the calendar strip spans. 'availableTimes' is an array of objects each with a 'date' field in YYYY-MM-DD format and a 'slots' array of time strings in 12-hour format (e.g. '9:00 AM', '2:30 PM'); an empty slots array means no availability on that date. Provide all dates that should show availability; dates not listed will have no slots. All fields are required.
